@startuml
title PinMyDay - Development & Deployment Flow (OIDC + Terraform)

actor Developer
participant "Local Machine\n(Terraform CLI)" as Local
participant "GitHub Repository" as Repo
participant "GitHub Actions" as Actions
participant "Azure Entra ID\n(App Registration)" as Entra
participant "Service Principal" as SP
participant "Azure Subscription" as Azure
participant "Terraform Backend\n(Azure Storage)" as Backend

== Local Development ==

Developer -> Local : Modify .tf files
Developer -> Local : terraform init
Local -> Backend : Read dev.tfstate
Developer -> Local : terraform plan
Developer -> Local : terraform apply (optional local test)
Local -> Azure : Azure API calls (via SP login)
Azure --> Local : Resource changes applied

== Commit & Push ==

Developer -> Repo : git commit
Developer -> Repo : git push

== CI/CD Pipeline ==

Repo -> Actions : Trigger workflow (dev/prod environment)

Actions -> Entra : Send OIDC token
Entra -> Entra : Validate federated credential
Entra -> SP : Issue short-lived Azure access token

Actions -> Backend : terraform init
Actions -> Azure : terraform plan
Actions -> Azure : terraform apply

Azure --> Backend : Update dev.tfstate / prod.tfstate
Azure --> Actions : Deployment successful

@enduml
